<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Budget blockage bad for Australia rates-govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Budget blockage bad for Australia rates-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Monday parliamentary blockage of key budget measures would increase pressure on interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;I have not got the slightest doubt...that if the Labor Party were successful in hacking into many of the savings achieved in the budget, that would automatically increase pressure on interest rates,&quot; Howard told parliament.</p>
</text>
